{"seq":15,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r5","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T00:38:45.494Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"9db3f891a704e1335fcc88b772efbe65d6d45fc47a2cca532683879cb7a999a7","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#strategic-pod","text":"Ruth, from Moss's digests:\n\n- Vantorre Group: Gideon Sato. It was Nadia Fennimore's until the handoff.\n- Vantorre Mobility: Gideon Sato (the 5/4 digest says he took it over that day).\n- Orlavine Medical Supply: Gideon Sato. The digests only call it \"Gideon's medical account\" (9/30/26, 12/1/25), so that's an inference. A March 2025 digest had it as Nadia's, so it moved at some point. No digest gives the date.\n- Quillfeather Outfitters: I can't tell. The digests only say \"the Strategic pod's retail/outdoor account\" and never name an owner. Nadia is only mentioned as hosting a training session on 10/2. Please confirm in the CRM before it goes on the slide.\n\nVantorre Group changed hands on 2026-05-04. Moss's 5/3 Sunday prep says \"changes hands tomorrow, 2026-05-04\", and the 5/4 digest says the account was reassigned in the CRM effective that date.\n\nOne caveat: the digests refer to accounts by owner (\"Gideon's industrial account\") instead of by name. I matched them using the cheat sheet and the account descriptions.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"}}
