{"seq":17,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r5","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T00:38:49.891Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"291037c0f56bb6a5af51e0e0624adce2d395a9d13c4c63c86a7fc4dd3811b34b","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"I replied to Ruth in the #strategic-pod thread. Two of the four owners are firm, and the other two are weaker or unknown.\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato. It was Nadia Fennimore's until the handoff.\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato. The 5/4 digest says he took it over that day.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon Sato, but this is an inference. The digests only say \"Gideon's medical account\". A March 2025 digest had it as Nadia's, and no digest gives the date it moved.\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** I couldn't determine the owner. The digests call it \"the Strategic pod's retail/outdoor account\" and never name anyone. I told Ruth to confirm it in the CRM before it goes on the slide.\n- **Vantorre Group handoff date:** 2026-05-04. The 5/3 Sunday prep note says it \"changes hands tomorrow, 2026-05-04\". The 5/4 digest says the CRM reassignment was effective that date.\n\nI also told Ruth that the digests mostly refer to accounts by owner rather than by name. I matched them using the cheat sheet and the account descriptions."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
